  { q: 'How much does a cold press oil machine cost?', a: 'Prices vary by model, material, and configuration. The best-selling HN325 is our most popular choice for cold press startups. Commercial and industrial models are available for larger operations. We also offer OEM/ODM customization for stainless steel and other special requirements. Tell us your seed type and target capacity — we send exact factory pricing with shipping to your port within 24 hours.' },
  { q: 'Which cold press model should I buy?', a: 'It depends on 2 key things: (1) which seed you press — soft seeds (walnut, almond, avocado) use HN325, medium-hard seeds (tea seed, olive) use HN400, hard seeds (coconut VCO, flaxseed) use HN426. (2) your daily capacity need — double-barrel versions boost output by 30-50%. Not sure? Tell us your seed + capacity — our engineer recommends 1-2 models with ROI calculation. Free, no obligation.' },
  { q: 'Is stainless steel available for edible oil?', a: 'Yes. We offer food-grade 304 stainless steel for all product-contact parts on HN325S, HN426S, and HN480BS models. This is required for VCO, extra virgin olive oil, and any product targeting EU/Japan/USA premium markets. The full chamber, pressing plates, oil pan, and oil collection tray are all SS304.' },
  { q: 'Can your cold press do VCO (Virgin Coconut Oil)?', a: 'Absolutely — this is our #1 most requested cold press application. Our HN426/HN480B series is specifically engineered for VCO production with: (1) true <45°C temperature, (2) stainless steel contact, (3) high pressure for maximum yield from dry coconut copra or wet coconut meat. We also provide VCO process consulting for free if you buy from us.' },
  { q: 'What oil yield can I expect from cold pressing?', a: 'Cold press yield is seed-specific and slightly lower than hot press, but preserves quality and commands 2-3× higher price. Typical cold yields with HN426: Sesame 88-90%, Peanut 82-85%, Coconut copra 62-65%, Walnut 85-88%, Almond 83-86%, Olive (pomace) 78-82%, Avocado 70-75%. We can do a free ROI calculation for your exact seed & price scenario.' },
